# Hashing Workflow

```text
             HASH FOUND
                 ↓
       ┌─────────────────┐
       │ Identify Format │
       └────────┬────────┘
                ↓
       Prefix / Length / Context
                ↓
       Verify with Hash Tool
                ↓
       Find Hashcat Mode
                ↓
       ┌────────────────────┐
       │ Hashcat / John     │
       └─────────┬──────────┘
                 ↓
          Candidate Inputs
                 ↓
          Hash + Compare
                 ↓
               MATCH
```

**Core idea:**

> **Identify the hash → understand its exact format/mode → choose the appropriate tool and method.**
